== Notes ==
* Despite the description, no touch attack is involved.
* Maximize spell, oddly, multiplies the total damage by 4 after the d4 rolls are made (thus the maximized spell does not always do the same amount of damage each casting and is significantly more powerful than the empowered spell).
* Since an ability score cannot be reduced to less than 3 (or 30 less than the base score whichever is higher), it is quite likely that the damage will sometimes exceed the amount the score is actually reduced.
* This is the only spell that the [[divination]] spell focus feats aid.
* Due to a .2da bug, ''heal'' is not an additional [[counterspell]] of this spell.

